      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Web application for tracking fleet maintenance: plan, control and expense recording. We developed Fleetrun for those who want to reduce operating costs, avoid critical breakdowns and reduce time spent at the service station. With this application you can control all kinds of services and expenses for individual spare parts, vehicles and even mileage. Fleetrun will show the services that the fleet needs, their intervals and costs.</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "Web application for tracking fleet maintenance: plan, control and expense recording. We developed Fleetrun for those who want to reduce operating costs, avoid critical breakdowns and reduce time spent at the service station. With this application you can control all kinds of services and expenses for individual spare parts, vehicles and even mileage. Fleetrun will show the services that the fleet needs, their intervals and costs.",
